        "contentHtml": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"color:#2D5A27;\">\u00a1Hola {{ $json.first_name }}!</h2><p>Thank you for reaching out! I'm Lorena, your El Paso real estate expert.</p><p>I noticed you're interested in <strong>{{ $json.source }}</strong>. I'd love to help you find the perfect home in El Paso.</p><p>I'll be in touch within the hour to learn more about what you're looking for.</p><p style=\"margin-top:20px;\">Warmly,<br><strong>Lorena</strong><br>Your El Paso Real Estate Expert<br>\ud83d\udcf1 Call/Text anytime</p></div>",
